+** OvVec: may overflow page pgno be read straight from the database file?
+**
+** sqlite3PagerDirectReadOk() refuses whenever any page in the cache is
+** dirty, which rules out every read made inside a write transaction --
+** UPDATE ... SET b=f(b), INSERT ... SELECT, or maintaining an index on a
+** column stored after a large value, which must read the whole value first.
+** What actually matters is this one page: a page leaves the cache only once
+** it is clean, so if it is neither cached nor in the WAL the file holds its
+** current content. The read happens at once, so that cannot change first.
