+** page is not in the page cache. Unlike sqlite3PagerDirectReadOk() this
+** may be used inside a write transaction: a page leaves the cache only once
+** it is clean, so any page absent from the cache is either on disk or, in
+** WAL mode, in a frame (checked here). Memory-mapped pagers are left to
+** the xFetch path, which is cheaper than any read.
